  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "main_8_level_main_08-03_beg",
  "groupId": "main_8",
  "stageId": "main_08-03",
  "title": "麦秆，极易燃烧",
  "storyCode": "R8-3",
  "avgTag": "行动前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/cn/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_08-03_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "be2516f1491db922d193c28dc02e4df43e1dceba3d69080273c453478863687a",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "晖洁：\n接着上次那件事说。\n我逃了很久，逃到一个小村子里。\n我当时没想那么多，只是想找个地方藏起来，没想到我真的找到了一个栖身之所。\n这一对老夫妇，可能是把我当做了他们的女儿。毕竟乌萨斯那么多场战争，他们的子女可能很早就牺牲了。\n就连我的秘密他们也帮忙藏住了。\n我想我怎么报答他们都不过分。\n遗憾的是，我没能好好报答他们。\n1月13日"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者纠察队",
      "text": "上一次的例行检查中，我们有一个队员遭到了袭击。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者纠察队",
      "text": "现在，每一户都要接受搜查。不仅是感染者，一旦我们发现袭击者，我们会立刻击杀他们，而窝藏他们的村户，也会受到惩罚。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者纠察队",
      "text": "不想服苦役的话，就告发他们。没人会因为你们光荣的报告受到伤害，而罪犯和感染者将得到他们应有的下场。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者纠察队",
      "text": "接下来，从第一户开始。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "text": "老奶奶，这一天还是来了。我肯定是躲不过的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老妇",
      "text": "别出去，塔露拉！藏在草棚后面......他们不会查的！我们就说你害怕受到惩罚，逃跑了！没有人会怪你的！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "text": "可你们会被伤害的。这不该是我报答你们的方式。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "text": "我留下了一点金币......这些是维多利亚金币，你们省着点花，一定够你们这辈子吃饱穿暖的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老妇",
      "text": "塔露拉，塔露拉！你要去哪？我的塔露拉......不可以，你不可以和他们见面啊！这些纠察队的黑虫子吃人不眨眼！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "text": "所以不能让他们再压榨村子里的叔叔阿姨了。这种事应该有个结束。我会引开他们，警醒他们，我会让他们知道后果。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "text": "我知道分寸的，老奶奶。我可不会让他们借机报复，再杀害村子里的人......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "text": "我还记得隔壁的弟弟只是因为扔了个石头就被活活打死。我忘不掉。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老妇",
      "text": "塔露拉......塔露拉！别这么说......别这么说！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老妇",
      "text": "谁！谁在敲门......是纠察队吗！走开！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿丽娜",
      "text": "老妈妈，是我！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老妇",
      "text": "阿丽娜！快进来，快进来！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老妇",
      "text": "怎么了？发生什么事了？有消息吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿丽娜",
      "text": "......有人告密了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老妇",
      "text": "啊？什么？什么告密？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿丽娜",
      "text": "纠察队知道我们村子里有一个感染者。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老妇",
      "text": "怎么可能，不会这样的......啊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿丽娜",
      "text": "我不知道他们从哪里得来的消息，但是我们都明白包藏感染者的下场是怎么个样子。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿丽娜",
      "text": "老妈妈，我爸爸去世得早，妈妈也全赖你们照顾，我把你们就当是我自己的爷爷奶奶一样。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿丽娜",
      "text": "到现在这个关头，我也没什么好隐瞒的......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "text": "——等等。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "text": "奶奶，爷爷他去了哪里？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者纠察队",
      "text": "臭老头子，你是来做什么的？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老汉",
      "text": "我犯了罪！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者纠察队",
      "text": "自首？啊，对，我记得了。我们那个队员是被一个老头拦下了。看你这一瘸一拐的，你就是当时的袭击者之一吧！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老汉",
      "text": "对！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者纠察队",
      "text": "......看你也没什么油水可敲。有多远滚多远吧。那个小崽子也是不知好歹，跟穷农民犟什么？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老汉",
      "text": "不止。老爷，你看看我身上这块，你看像什么？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者纠察队",
      "text": "——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者纠察队",
      "text": "感染者！感染者就是你？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "text": "你说什么？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老妇",
      "text": "我当时给你换衣服的时候，都看到啦......塔露拉，你是感染者，我和老头子知道很久了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "text": "那——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老妇",
      "text": "老头子去矿场赚点钱，也是染了矿石病才回来的！你看他一直穿着他那个夹克不肯脱掉......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老妇",
      "text": "老头子是要替你顶罪啊，塔露拉......！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "text": "不行！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "text": "这岂不是说爷爷他......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老妇",
      "text": "村子里那些人都信不过的！只要是为了钱，为了保命，他们什么事儿都能往外说！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老妇",
      "text": "这两年，塔露拉，我们真的很欢喜你！你是个好孩子......是个好孩子！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老妇",
      "text": "我们也没几天好活了，但是你，塔露拉，就算得了病，你也是能再多活几年的！你得好好活着才行......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老妇",
      "text": "塔露拉，别去！别去啊......！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老汉",
      "text": "抓我走。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老汉",
      "text": "老爷，抓我走吧！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老汉",
      "text": "你看我这身上！我才是那个得了病的！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者纠察队",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老汉",
      "text": "不信的话，你就看看这个吧！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者纠察队",
      "text": "刀？把刀放下。老头，你伤不到我们。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老汉",
      "text": "不，老爷，你看看我的法术......你看看我的法术！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "老人切开了自己的手腕，红色没有流进雪地，而是像雾一样弥散在空气中。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老汉",
      "text": "你看，你看......老爷！我是货真价实的感染者！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者纠察队",
      "text": "我相信。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者纠察队",
      "text": "感谢你的合作，感染者。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老汉",
      "text": "唔......唔......！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老汉",
      "text": "塔露拉......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿丽娜",
      "text": "塔露拉！回来！别去！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿丽娜",
      "text": "这是......火？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿丽娜",
      "text": "这是什么？！为什么房子烧起来了——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿丽娜",
      "text": "塔露拉！这是你——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿丽娜",
      "text": "不要去！！塔露拉！！这样整个村子都会遭殃的！！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
